@title Icon gallery: the drawn icon set and the command table, dark and light
@area Layout
# Lane V0 of the visual redesign (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 14).
# Opened from the command field; checked at 16 and 20 points in both themes.
fresh
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text icon gallery
wait 8
shot search
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Icon gallery"
expect "All at 16 and 20 pt"
expect "Frequency drive"
shot drawn-dark
check_layout
click_text Commands
wait 6
expect "file.new"
shot commands-dark
text xref
wait 6
shot commands-filtered-dark
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 6
shot commands-light
click_text "Drawn icons"
wait 6
shot drawn-light
check_layout
